# Everything is excluded except what the image build needs (an allowlist), so secrets, market
# data, results, state files, caches, the .git folder and local venvs never reach the daemon.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
# Explicitly, in case the allowlist above is edited:
.git
.env*
moonshot.env
data/
results/
research/
state/
.venv
.*_cache
*.sqlite*
docs/
